Notes:
- map_type 2 marks this as a raid in placement CSVs.
- difficulty_id 0 maps to LootMode 1. In this core's raid enum, 1 is
  25-player normal, 2 is 10-player heroic, and 3 is 25-player heroic.
- Four Horsemen (creature 16064) is intentionally absent because the current
  source snapshot has no creature lootid for that credit entry.
- Add a separate trash encounter using exact source creature loot entries if
  you want Naxx trash separated from boss pools.
- A recipe using profile naxx_10_normal is weighted across these bosses unless
  it sets "target" to one encounter ID.

To make a 25-player normal profile, copy this object and change:
  "id": "naxx_25_normal",
  "difficulty": "25-player normal",
  "difficulty_id": 1,
  "loot_mode": 2

