8) PLANNED 20 LEGENDARIES - CURRENTLY BLOCKED BY GLOBAL POLICY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

{
  "id": "twenty_legendaries",
  "count": 20,
  "quality": 5,
  "required_level": [80, 80],
  "item_level": [264, 284],
  "target_kind": "general"
}

The current validator intentionally expects approximately three legendary
items per 100,000 generated items. Because the generator caps a run at
200,000 items, this exact 20-item recipe cannot pass yet. It needs an explicit
manifest legendary-quota policy before being uncommented.

